      "notes": "In force since 2025-06-19: ZInfV-1, published in Uradni list RS, št. 40/2025 (2025-06-04), repealed the 2018 ZInfV (Art. 69) with a one-year survival of its rules for the operators it already covered (Art. 62). Significant incidents go to SI-CERT (SIGOV-CERT for public administration) since 2025-06-19, self-registration with URSIV is due within 30 days of qualifying (first window closed 2025-12-19), and the Art. 21-22 risk-management measures are due by 2026-12-19 for most entities (Art. 62(1); former operators of essential services, designated state bodies and e-communications operators had until 2026-06-19, Art. 62(2)-(3)). Commission infringement case closed 2026-01-30."
